      <title>'Minor strikes', a task force called Iron Gate, and missiles on Kyiv's Northern Bridge</title>
      <description>Trump announces 'minor' US strikes on Iranian air defences as Central Command sets up Task Force Iron Gate against Iran's land routes and offers a reward for nuclear intelligence, Russian missiles hit Kyiv's Northern Bridge ahead of the Abu Dhabi talks, Ukraine strikes the Saratov and Afipsky refineries, and reported strikes in Lebanon and Yemen.&lt;p&gt;Sources:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.cnbc.com/2026/11/07/trump-us-minor-strikes-iran-qeshm-island.html"&gt;CNBC: Trump's 'minor strikes'&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/11/7/trump-confirms-new-us-strikes-on-irans-qeshm-island"&gt;Al Jazeera: new strikes on Qeshm&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://thehill.com/policy/defense/6205977-trump-launches-iran-limited-strikes/"&gt;The Hill: strikes on air defences&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.washingtonpost.com/national-security/2026/11/07/us-military-seeks-disrupt-irans-land-routes-expanding-naval-blockade/"&gt;Washington Post: Task Force Iron Gate&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.khaleejtimes.com/world/mena/us-to-set-up-new-team-against-iran-land-commerce-task-force-iron-gate"&gt;Khaleej Times: Iron Gate details&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.cnn.com/2026/11/07/middleeast/trump-reward-intelligence-iran-nuclear-program-intl"&gt;CNN: nuclear intelligence reward&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://france24.com/en/europe/20261107-moscow-strikes-kyiv-as-ukraine-prepares-for-talks-with-russia-and-the-us"&gt;France 24: Kyiv strikes&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.rferl.org/a/russia-strikes-kyiv-ukraine-trilateral-talks/33892815.html"&gt;RFE/RL: Northern Bridge and Abu Dhabi talks&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://ukrmedia.news/en/world/saratovskyi-npz-ataka-7-lystopada-2026/"&gt;UkrMedia: Saratov refinery&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://mili