      <title>Is a US–Iran deal getting closer? Plus a deadly tanker strike off Qatar</title>
      <description>Bloomberg reports the US and Iran edging toward a deal with Iran's nuclear programme back on the table, a seafarer killed on the tanker Velos Sapphire north of Qatar and another blast off Khasab, a reported strike on the Afipsky refinery, the latest front-line numbers, and a Houthi missile aimed at Medina.&lt;p&gt;Sources:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-06/us-and-iran-edge-closer-to-deal-with-nuclear-issue-back-in-play"&gt;Bloomberg: US and Iran edge closer to a deal&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.arabnews.com/middle-east/us-and-iran-edge-closer-to-potential-breakthrough-in-talks-to-end-war-bloomberg-3010128"&gt;Arab News: potential breakthrough&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.cbsnews.com/live-updates/iran-war-trump-us-strait-hormuz-persian-gulf/"&gt;CBS News: Trump on new strikes&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://lloydslist.com/LL1158929/Seafarer-killed-as-tanker-attack-underscores-widening-Middle-East-Gulf-threat"&gt;Lloyd's List: seafarer killed&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.rivieramm.com/news-content-hub/seafarer-killed-in-attack-on-greek-owned-tanker-in-middle-east-gulf-90497"&gt;Riviera: Velos Sapphire attack&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.arabnews.com/middle-east/tanker-reports-explosion-near-omans-khasab-while-transiting-strait-of-hormuz-ukmto-says-3010151"&gt;Arab News: explosion off Khasab&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://kyivpost.com/post/89302"&gt;Kyiv Post: Afipsky refinery&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://mezha.net/eng/news/mezha-fad66d54cfb0b43b46de226f"&gt;Mezha: 188 clashes&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.kiro7.com/news/business/israeli-strike-kills/RVYTKG3KBI5KNGJEQMH5UFLPH4/"&gt;AP via KIRO 7: Gaza, Medina missile&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://middleeasteye.net/live-blog/live-blog-update/isr