      <title>The morning after the midterms: Iran reads the vote, and talks stall in Doha</title>
      <description>Iran says US voters rejected the war as Democrats take Congress and Trump pushes back, Doha talks end without a breakthrough while more tankers are hit around Hormuz, another 310-drone night over Ukraine, a White House meeting on the Oleshky truce, and the Theodore Roosevelt still in the South China Sea.&lt;p&gt;Sources:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.cnbc.com/2026/11/04/us-midterm-elections-iran-war-speaker.html"&gt;CNBC: Iran says Americans voted 'no to war'&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://gulfnews.com/world/mena/middle-east-conflict-trump-warns-of-heavy-hit-as-iran-says-americans-voted-no-to-war-1.500735100"&gt;Gulf News: Trump warns of 'heavy hit'&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/11/4/iran-says-us-reply-to-hormuz-plan-unconvincing-trump-confirms-strikes"&gt;Al Jazeera: Iran calls US reply unconvincing&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://iranwire.com/en/news/159779-irgc-claims-four-tankers-destroyed-by-mines-in-strait-of-hormuz/"&gt;IranWire: IRGC mine claims&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.kyivpost.com/post/89068"&gt;Kyiv Post: 310 drones overnight&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.ukrinform.net/amp/rubric-ato/4181220-air-defense-neutralizes-272-of-310-drones-launched-by-russia-against-ukraine-overnight.html"&gt;Ukrinform: 272 of 310 drones downed&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.yahoo.com/news/world/articles/ukraines-general-staff-reports-208-070300042.html"&gt;Yahoo News: 208 clashes&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://kyivpost.com/post/89091"&gt;Kyiv Post: Samara fire burns a second day&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.cnn.com/2026/11/03/politics/melania-trump-russia-ukraine"&gt;CNN: Melania Trump to host envoys&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.cnbc.com/2026/11/03/russia-ukraine-peace-talks-abu-dhabi-trump-putin-xi.html"&gt;CN