      <title>US strikes Qeshm on the eve of the vote, and a deadly night for Ukraine</title>
      <description>Limited US strikes on Iran's Qeshm Island as Vance talks up a deal, one of the deadliest Russian strikes of the war at an aid centre in Komyshuvakha, a huge overnight barrage on Ukraine's grid and a Kharkiv hospital, Ukraine's strike on the Yaroslavl refinery, and the Theodore Roosevelt moving into the South China Sea.&lt;p&gt;Sources:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.cnn.com/2026/11/02/politics/us-strikes-iran-qeshm-island"&gt;CNN: US strikes on Qeshm Island&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.nbcnews.com/world/iran/us-conducted-defensive-strikes-iranian-targets-strait-hormuz-us-offici-rcna607161"&gt;NBC News: limited strikes on Qeshm&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.cnbc.com/2026/11/03/iran-us-vance-trump-strikes.html"&gt;CNBC: Vance hopes for settlement&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.ibtimes.com/iran-us-deal-hormuz-talks-vance-optimism-3809315"&gt;IBTimes: Tehran says deal still elusive&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.pravda.com.ua/eng/news/2026/11/03/8061054/"&gt;Ukrainska Pravda: Komyshuvakha toll&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://kyivindependent.com/exceptionally-horrific-strike-russian-bombs-strike-school-used-as-humanitarian-aid-center-in-zaporizhzhia-oblast-killing-24/"&gt;Kyiv Independent: Komyshuvakha strike&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.kyivpost.com/post/88968"&gt;Kyiv Post: overnight barrage&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.pravda.com.ua/eng/news/2026/11/03/8060956/"&gt;Ukrainska Pravda: Kharkiv hospital&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.themoscowtimes.com/2026/11/03/ukrainian-drones-hit-yaroslavl-oil-refinery-trigger-power-outages-in-crimea-a94162"&gt;The Moscow Times: Yaroslavl refinery and Crimea&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.yahoo.com/news/world/articles/russia-conducted-206-combat-clashes-063400787.html"&gt;Yahoo News: 206 c