      <title>Iran's two-day offer, a busy night at sea, and Ukraine's oil campaign widens</title>
      <description>Iran offers to reopen Hormuz within two days on its terms as three more vessels are hit around the Gulf, Ukraine strikes a major Russian oil hub after three refineries, Russia's overnight drone attacks, Sudan's power grid under fire, and China's coast guard patrols east of Taiwan.&lt;p&gt;Sources:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.rte.ie/news/2026/1102/1597573-iran-strikes/"&gt;RTÉ: Iran's conditions for reopening Hormuz&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.aljazeera.com/news/liveblog/2026/11/2/iran-war-live-tankers-hit-in-hormuz-trump-again-says-conflict-to-end-soon"&gt;Al Jazeera live: Nov 2&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.cbsnews.com/live-updates/iran-war-us-trump-diplomacy-threat-resume-attacks/"&gt;CBS News: Trump on ending the war&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.seatrade-maritime.com/security/tanker-hit-off-saudi-and-offshore-tug-struck-in-hormuz"&gt;Seatrade Maritime: tanker and tug hit&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.arabtimesonline.com/news/tensions-rise-in-strait-of-hormuz-as-ukmto-reports-vessel-hit-iran-claims-two-tankers-hit-mines/"&gt;Arab Times: UKMTO Lavan Island report&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.jpost.com/middle-east/iran-news/article-913514"&gt;Jerusalem Post: IRGC mine claims&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://themoscowtimes.com/2026/11/02/ukrainian-drones-hit-major-oil-transport-hub-in-samara-region-a94149"&gt;The Moscow Times: Samara oil hub&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.kyivpost.com/post/88850"&gt;Kyiv Post: overnight Russian attacks&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://kyivindependent.com/russian-attacks-kill-2-injure-over-30-across-ukraine-over-past-day-as-10-regions-face-power-outages/"&gt;Kyiv Independent: outages in 10 regions&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.ukrinform.net/rubric-ato/4180385-war-update-205-clashes-on-front